<#ff5a96>MOON HEALING</>
Moon Healing (hold)		^X
  The Silver Crystal heals her while X is held: about
  40 life a second, spending about a third of a bar a
  second. Getting hit, letting go or running out of
  meter ends it.
Planet Power (1 bar)		_D_D^B_+^C
  3 seconds: faster, free chains, chip damage, supers
  cost less. No guarding or meter gain.

<#ff5a96>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Dash / Back Dash (air too)		_F_F / _B_B
Super Jump		_D_U

<#ff5a96>NORMALS</>
Light Punch / Heavy Punch / Heavy Kick		^A / ^B / ^C
  Tap Light again for her auto combo.
Light Kick		_F^A
Launcher Kick		_F^C
Crouching Light / Heavy Punch		_D^A / _D^B
Crouching Heavy Kick		_D^C
Air Light / Heavy / Kick		^A / ^B / ^C
Jumpdown Attack (air)		_D^A
Cross-up Attack (air)		_D^B / _D^C

<#ff5a96>SPECIALS</>
Moon Tiara Action		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Spiral Heart Attack (air)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Moon Screw Punch		_F_D_DF^A / ^B
Twilight Flash		_D_DB_B^A / ^B
Silver Crystal		_B_DB_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Sailor Body Attack (air)		_B_DB_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Moon Princess Halation (EX)		_D_DF_F^C
Rainbow Moon Heartache (EX, air)		_D_DF_F^C
Rising Moon (EX)		_F_D_DF^C
  EX moves cost 500 meter.

<#ff5a96>SUPERS</>
Moon Tiara Stardust (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
  Unblockable.
Supersonic Cry (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Any two of A/B/C work. Planet Power makes them cheaper.
Moon Princess Halation (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Three bouncing light orbs, each stronger than the EX.
